  "description": "Bring your designs to life with Comic Brush, a bold and energetic brush typeface inspired by the expressive strokes of hand-painted lettering and classic comic aesthetics. Designed with smooth brush textures and natural movement, this font delivers a fun yet stylish personality that instantly grabs attention.\nWhether you’re creating eye-catching headlines, comic book titles, branding, packaging, posters, or social media graphics, Comic Brush adds a lively and authentic handwritten feel to every project. Its bold appearance makes it highly readable while maintaining a playful, handcrafted charm that works beautifully across both digital and print designs.\nFrom retro-inspired artwork to modern creative branding, Comic Brush is versatile enough to complement a wide range of styles. It’s perfect for designers who want typography that feels spontaneous, expressive, and full of character.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Bring your designs to life with Comic Brush, a bold and energetic brush typeface inspired by the expressive strokes of hand-painted lettering and classic comic aesthetics. Designed with smooth brush textures and natural movement, this font delivers a fun yet stylish personality that instantly grabs attention.</p>\n<p>Whether you’re creating eye-catching headlines, comic book titles, branding, packaging, posters, or social media graphics, Comic Brush adds a lively and authentic handwritten feel to every project. Its bold appearance makes it highly readable while maintaining a playful, handcrafted charm that works beautifully across both digital and print designs.</p>\n<p>From retro-inspired artwork to modern creative branding, Comic Brush is versatile enough to complement a wide range of styles. It’s perfect for designers who want typography that feels spontaneous, expressive, and full of character.</p>",
